        "reason": "Bespoke on both: a card of the family (shells/card.mjs), drawn from Figma's layers, its StatusIndicator composed in a tile of its severity and its More a menu of its own; pressable where it is given something to do, its title then the stretched action (owner decision 2026-09-25)."
